{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13","cat":"counsel","group":{"id":"char5186","label":"Scarlet: Goddeath"},"label":"Advising Scarlet: Goddeath: 13","stage":null,"prev":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_12","next":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_14","speakers":{"hongryeon_g":"Scarlet"},"icons":{"hongryeon_g":"si_c472_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_g","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_1","text":"Should we reclaim the surface, I would fain pass my days tending the fields of some quiet farm.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CommanderRoom","bgArt":"commanderroom","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_backtonormal","movie":null,"shown":["hongryeon_g"],"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_g","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_2","text":"And thou, what wouldst thou do once we have reclaimed it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_3","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_3","text":"I want to enjoy nature and live somewhere quiet.","jump":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_5","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_120"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_4","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_4","text":"I want to live in the city with everyone else.","jump":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_8","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_100"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_g","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_5","text":"That, too, is a most agreeable idea.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_g","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_6","text":"What a fulfilling life it would be, to leave the clamor of the world behind and revel in nature's splendor.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_g","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_7","text":"I should dearly like that day to come sooner.","jump":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_11","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_g","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_8","text":"Aye, I can see how leaving the city might prove somewhat trying for thee.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_g","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_9","text":"Forsooth, the city hath its pleasures,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_g","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_10","text":"yet for mine own part, I find nature's gifts far greater.","jump":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_11","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_11","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_hongryeon_goddeath_13_11","text":"Scarlet and I envision a future after reclaiming the surface.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"none","bgArt":"none","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"}]}